      "note": "The vulnerable helper takes the font-backed `Coverage` object by value as ctor-local `t1` instead of by reference, so constructing `hb_auto_t<Coverage::Iter>` copies the short blob-end object past the heap extent that sanitization allocated for the GSUB table.",
